  "travel_tips": [
    "Book pet reservation immediately after booking your ticket (limited spots)",
    "Acclimate your pet to the travel cage 2-3 weeks before departure",
    "Place familiar blanket or toy in the cage for comfort",
    "Freeze water in bowl before flight to prevent spills",
    "Attach a recent photo of your pet to the cage for identification",
    "Carry a travel health kit including: sedatives (if prescribed), water bowl, small amount of food, leash, waste bags",
    "Avoid feeding 4-6 hours before flight to prevent motion sickness",
    "Provide water up to 2 hours before departure",
    "Exercise your pet before heading to the airport",
    "Inform airline staff if your pet requires special assistance",
    "Carry a copy of all documents in your hand luggage (originals with pet)",
    "Label cage with: your name, destination address, phone number, pet's name",
    "Check destination country quarantine requirements before booking",
    "Never sedate brachycephalic breeds (pugs, bulldogs, boxers) - breathing risks",
    "Avoid connecting flights when possible (reduce stress and handling)"
  ],

